syndicontract-info-1 = SyndTract v2.0

syndicontract-info-2 = We've identified potentional high-value targets that are

syndicontract-info-3 = currently assigned to your mission area. They are believed

syndicontract-info-4 = to hold valuable information which could be of immediate

syndicontract-info-5 = importance to our organisation.

syndicontract-info-6 = Listed below are all of the contracts available to you. You

syndicontract-info-7 = are to bring the specified target to the designated

syndicontract-info-8 = drop-off, and contact us via this uplink. We will send

syndicontract-info-9 = a specialised extraction unit to put the body into.

syndicontract-info-10 = We want targets alive - but we will sometimes pay slight

syndicontract-info-11 = amounts if they're not, you just won't receive the shown

syndicontract-info-12 = bonus. You can redeem your payment through this uplink in

syndicontract-info-13 = the form of raw telecrystals, which can be put into your

syndicontract-info-14 = regular Syndicate uplink to purchase whatever you may need.

syndicontract-info-15 = We provide you with these crystals the moment you send the

syndicontract-info-16 = target up to us, which can be collected at anytime through

syndicontract-info-17 = this system.

syndicontract-info-18 = Targets extracted will be ransomed back to the station once

syndicontract-info-19 = their use to us is fulfilled, with us providing you a small

syndicontract-info-20 = percentage cut. You may want to be mindful of them

syndicontract-info-21 = identifying you when they come back. We provide you with

syndicontract-info-22 = a standard contractor loadout, which will help cover your

syndicontract-info-23 = identity.

